          "short": "$x=40$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{5}&=15-7\\\\\\frac{x}{5}&=8\\\\x&=8\\times5\\\\x&=40\\end{align*}$$\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=\\frac{40}{5}+7\\\\&=15\\\\&=\\text{RHS}\\end{align*}$$",
